`modelFingerprintAdopted`, by sharded live regens (`RUNAR_VERIFICATION_REGEN=1 RUNAR_VERIFICATION_SHARD=n
RUNAR_VERIFICATION_SHARDS=20`) against the model on disk. ALL 8 live anchors
