encode the depth push internally, see `Script/Emit.lean:176-178`);
`oversize-bigint-shift`, `bitwise-ops`, `boolean-logic` and `shift-ops`
(the NEW-004 `rawSlots` thread); `if-else`, `branch-merged-locals`,
